## 4. Pre-change checklist

Complete every item before the change window. Record results in the Sign-off table (Section 10).

### 4.1 Network fabric (network team)

- [ ] PFC enabled on RoCE priority (default priority 3) on all server-facing ports for `ens1f2`
- [ ] ECN / DCQCN enabled for the RoCE traffic class
- [ ] RoCE VLAN (`<VLAN_ID>`) allowed on the trunk to each server
- [ ] UDP port 4791 not blocked between nodes
- [ ] MTU consistent end to end

### 4.2 Cluster health

```bash
oc get nodes
oc get co | grep -v "True        False         False"
oc get sriovnetworknodestates -n openshift-sriov-network-operator
```

- [ ] All nodes `Ready`
- [ ] No degraded cluster operators
- [ ] All node states `Succeeded / Idle / Idle`

### 4.3 Current SR-IOV state on `ens1f2`

