## 8. Troubleshooting

| Symptom | Likely cause | Action |
|---|---|---|
| Webhook rejects policy | `isRdma` with `vfio-pci`, overlapping VF range, or `numVfs` mismatch | Check `deviceType: netdevice`, range `9-12`, `numVfs: 16` |
| Node stuck in `Draining` | Pod with PDB or local storage blocking eviction | `oc get events -n openshift-sriov-network-operator`, `oc adm drain` dry-run on the node |
| Node stuck in `InProgress` > 30 min | Config daemon error | `oc logs -n openshift-sriov-network-operator ds/sriov-network-config-daemon --all-containers` on that node |
| `rdma_sriov_net` = 0 | `irdma` not loaded or VF not RDMA-enabled | `lsmod \| grep irdma`, `rdma link show` on node |
| Pod `Pending` | Resource typo or no free VFs | `oc describe pod`, `oc describe node \| grep rdma` |
| `/dev/infiniband` empty in pod | Device plugin did not inject devices | `oc logs -n openshift-sriov-network-operator ds/sriov-device-plugin` on that node |
| `ibv_reg_mr` fails | Missing `IPC_LOCK` | Check pod `securityContext` |
| `ib_write_bw` hangs | UDP 4791 blocked, wrong GID, VLAN not trunked | `show_gids` in pod, ping over `net1`, confirm VLAN with network team |
| Single stream OK, multi-stream collapses | PFC/ECN not configured | Escalate to network team; `ethtool -S ens1f2 \| grep -i pause` on node |
| `PORT_DOWN` in `ibv_devinfo` | PF link down | `ip link show ens1f2` on node |

Useful log sources:

```bash
oc logs -n openshift-sriov-network-operator deploy/sriov-network-operator
oc logs -n openshift-sriov-network-operator ds/sriov-network-config-daemon --all-containers
oc logs -n openshift-sriov-network-operator ds/sriov-device-plugin
journalctl -u kubelet -b | grep -i sriov        # on the node
dmesg | grep -iE "irdma|iavf|ice"                # on the node
```

